# Pre-Commit Documentation Validation

Enforces documentation organization rules before commits, ensuring all documentation follows the automated-documentation.mdc standards.

## When to Apply

This rule always applies (`alwaysApply: true`) to validate documentation organization automatically.

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable validation patterns.

